  "notes": "2-channel tube (12AX7) mic/line preamp with EQ (19\" rack). Per channel, from the specifications: XLR mic input, line input on XLR and 6.35 mm jack, servo-balanced output on XLR and 6.35 mm jack. Jack type (TRS) assumed from 'balanced and unbalanced'; XLR genders follow the usual convention (not stated). Controls from the Quick Start Guide, 'Controls' (1-18), per channel: +48 V, MIC/LINE, MIC GAIN (10-60 dB, MIC mode only), PHASE REV., LO CUT with its FREQUENCY (12-320 Hz), parametric EQ (FREQUENCY with x0.1 / x10 range switches, BANDWIDTH, LEVEL +/-15 dB, EQ IN/OUT) and OUTPUT (+/-20 dB). Modelled: in MIC mode only the MIC input is used, in LINE mode the line inputs (the guide: phantom power is disabled in LINE mode). OUTPUT at minimum is -20 dB, not silent. The guide describes one channel; both channels are taken to be identical.",
